@startuml
 title Architecture 1 expense state machine - complementary to expense-activity.puml
[*] --> Pending : Valid submission + shares + policy snapshot\n+ notifications in one transaction
Pending --> Pending : Current eligible reviewer approves\nmore levels remain; no posting
Pending --> Pending : Manager reassigns pending step\naudit only; no posting
Pending --> Approved : Final reviewer approves\natomic state + ledger + balances
Pending --> Rejected : Current reviewer rejects\nno ledger effects
Approved --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]
note right of Pending
Expense lock and expected version.
No self-review under provisional D3; no out-of-order decision.
Retry cannot duplicate effects.
end note
note right of Rejected
Correction is a new submission
referencing the original.
end note
@enduml
